{"id": "travel-eval-test-006", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "1fbf90ee324df0485ad7ddc06e69bf556bd6c71053fa788c98a64be1ee6db1ce", "prompt_tokens": 420, "generated_tokens": 64, "generation_seconds": 3.089, "answer": "资料认为，市区适合抵达日、返程日和以天门山为主的行程。它的好处是城市配套完整，交通衔接也更省心。\n\n如果你担心行李、晚到、早走，或者第二天先去天门山，市区通常比武陵源更稳。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-test-007", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "53f4db70e6b66750e6360cd87021401e07fb81d32bfde7240533d1b167a58118", "prompt_tokens": 425, "generated_tokens": 60, "generation_seconds": 2.9023, "answer": "武陵源适合森林公园整日游，也适合减少清晨通勤，住这里第二天出发更接近景区节奏。[1]\n\n它的短板是离市区交通节点更远，所以如果你的重点不是森林公园，而是先去天门山或当天返程，市区通常更适合。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-test-008", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "83171b488fbe84f4a7005b97dfbdf8470d2598080939c0c61622655e21167b87", "prompt_tokens": 390, "generated_tokens": 32, "generation_seconds": 1.583, "answer": "不建议为了网红餐厅专门折返。资料强调，景区附近能顺路吃，就尽量不要让吃饭拖累行程。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
